cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RamanujanSimulator in research, please cite this software artifact."
title: "RamanujanSimulator: Constructive Implicit Precision via Nested Modular State Transport"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Wong"
    given-names: "Zining Kestis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MatrixFreeSama/RamanujanSimulator"
url: "https://github.com/MatrixFreeSama/RamanujanSimulator"
date-released: 2026-08-24
abstract: >-
  RamanujanSimulator is an experimental C17 research implementation that
  separates nested modular convergence-state propagation from optional explicit
  materialization of pi. The active 10K^4 construction propagates a compact
  hypergeometric state, emits a constructive certificate, and provides an
  independent certificate-to-explicit reference recovery path.
keywords:
  - pi
  - Ramanujan
  - Chudnovsky
  - modular equations
  - hypergeometric functions
  - arbitrary precision
  - constructive certificate
  - implicit representation
  - scientific computing
